---
title: "HackMatch — US-035: Realtime Typing Indicator Sequence"
---
%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"background":"#ffffff","primaryColor":"#e8f1ff","primaryTextColor":"#1f2937","primaryBorderColor":"#3b82f6","lineColor":"#4b5563","secondaryColor":"#f1e8ff","tertiaryColor":"#fff7d6","fontFamily":"Arial, sans-serif"},"sequence":{"useMaxWidth":true,"diagramMarginX":25,"diagramMarginY":18,"actorMargin":34,"width":165,"height":60,"boxMargin":8,"messageMargin":24,"noteMargin":10}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Typist as Typing PART
    participant Composer as Composer (useConversationTyping)
    participant API as Typing routes
    participant Hub as TypingHub (server memory)
    participant Indicator as Viewer's TypingIndicator
    actor Viewer as Viewing PART

    Viewer->>Indicator: Open a forum, team chat, or DM
    Indicator->>API: GET …/typing/stream (bearer token, read guard)
    API->>Hub: Subscribe this viewer to this one conversation
    API-->>Indicator: ready with typingExpiryMs 6000, no earlier state

    Typist->>Composer: Type in the message box
    Composer->>API: POST …/typing with only { typing: true }, at most every 2 s
    API->>API: Auth, typing enabled, 40 signals per minute, send guard
    API->>Hub: Signal for the session's participant (Invisible: nothing published)
    Hub->>Hub: Start or refresh this typist's 6-second expiry
    Hub->>Hub: Recheck each viewer's read access, skip the sender
    Hub-->>Indicator: SSE typing event with handle, typing true, expiresAt
    Indicator-->>Viewer: "avery is typing…" (polite status)
    Indicator->>Indicator: Hide locally 6 s after the event arrives

    alt Message sent, box cleared, blur, or conversation left
        Composer->>API: Best-effort { typing: false }
        Hub-->>Indicator: typing false, entry removed at once
    else No stop arrives (tab closed, network lost)
        Hub->>Hub: Expire after 6 s and publish typing false
    else Viewer lost read access
        Hub-->>Indicator: Close the stream, event not delivered
    end

    Note over Composer,Indicator: No database writes, no draft text, no history. Navigation or account change closes<br/>the stream and clears state, and a reconnect starts empty. Typing failures never block sending.
